uncomfortable. Thus, she has no friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the English site."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43353"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"１年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生まれつき長身で現在の身長は１７３センチ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本的に無害な性格なのだが、きつめの顔立ち、滲み出る暗い雰囲気のせいで、周りからは怖がられてしまい、いわゆるボッチの状態となっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、本人はその状況を受けいれ、このまま１人静かに過ごしたいと思っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7751","sourceWorkId":"22953","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"173 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7751","sourceWorkId":"22953","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c6b71d830dd0319d10d09a44757f549c13d81f5cd1714ddfcf97c3a9386a7b9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d257036b6b3709a645ff720ac9af37d58742d49f867be10de38885916f3d59d8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"氷青","creatorId":"vndb:s125","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s125","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s125","name":"海原エレナ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:165784:38163:4937:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c43354","characterName":"平泉 巳紀","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"38164","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"165784"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7752"],"vndbCharacterId":"c43354"},"originalCharacterName":"平泉 巳紀","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"185"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Personality: Earnest (Masochist?) Gentleman"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Dolls, Fashion"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Sycophants"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"You're my MUSE!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I knew it. It was you all along! You're the one I've been searching for!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From an early age, Miki has always loved making clothes. However, growing up in America, he was bullied by the jocks for having a \"girly\" hobby. To make matters worse, his father constantly shamed him for it. Eventually, Miki got fed up and returned to Japan on his own... but without a muse to stimulate his creativity, he's been stagnating. However, his chance encounter with the protagonist sets off a spark inside him!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the English site."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43354"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"１年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子どもの時から服作りが好き。しかし、繊細すぎる趣味としてアメリカでマッチョなイジメを受け、父親からもそんな趣味はやめろと言われ続ける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな生活が嫌になり日本に帰国したものの、己の創造力をかき立てるような存在に巡り会えず、行き詰まっていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、主人公というミューズと出会ったことで、彼の才能は一気に爆発する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7752","sourceWorkId":"22953","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"185 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7752","sourceWorkId":"22953","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fa70e4124dc7418ac32985b2ea5908cef353e1ace92507934a88b78ac36fa094.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0df13cc796833cd72cefd6e91bd5eb4a84034b54a547f3a028ccf740c0c4d549.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"白井悠介","creatorId":"vndb:s6948","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6948","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6948","name":"白井悠介","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:165784:38164:16335:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c43355","characterName":"新條 才人","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"38165","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"165784"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7753"],"vndbCharacterId":"c43355"},"originalCharacterName":"新條 才人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"170"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Personality: Perfectionist (Sadist?) Negotiator"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Cameras, Other People's Misery, Idols (JUST ADMIT IT)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Bugs, Wasteful Spending"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Oh shit... The second I said 'sow', I got chills. Man, I can't get enough of your pain and misery.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"You have no say in this.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Saito is the perfect student, the type who can master anything he tries. He has top-level grades, exceptional athletic ability, loads of friends, and has always been popular with the ladies. But this cushy life has led him to stop bothering to put actual effort into anything. Then he learns about the protagonist and hatches an ambitious plan..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the English site."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43355"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"１年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なんでもスマートにこなす優等生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績は常に上位で、運動神経も良し。友達も多く、小さいときからモテ人生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、何でもこなせるがゆえに、何に対しても熱くなれないという贅沢な悩みを抱えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな時、主人公の存在を知り、彼の野望に火がつくこととなる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7753","sourceWorkId":"22953","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8afe3f85d6e349262d2200a562f3379c458bfa6b28602682817f0643a4c95723.webp",